{
"about": "Held out (tools/eval-assistant.cjs --cases apps/assistant/eval/held-out.json): written on 11 October 2026 after the fixes the main set (cases.json) led to, and never used to change the grammar or the router, so they measure how the fixes carry over to words nobody tuned for. Add new cases to cases.json, never here.",
"cases": [
